[00:31.78]When you left home for work with your bag
[00:31.78]当你提着公文包离家工作
[00:36.56]I wasn't sure that you'd ever come back
[00:36.56]我不确定你是否还会回来
[00:40.44]And I guess I ****ed up
[00:40.44]或许是我搞砸了一切
